    "description": "This sun-filled, fully vacant duplex sits on a prized corner lot in Central Richmond District offering a rare chance for investors or visionaries to reimagine a legacy property. Fully detached on three sides with fresh exterior paint, it boasts radiant Eastern, Southern, and Western exposures. Each flat features 2 beds, 1 bath, a formal dining room, and a spacious living room with bay windows, original built-ins, and a fireplace. Both units have private garages, and the lower-level ceiling height may offer expansion potential (buyer to verify). Internal stairs lead to a 2-year-old roof with panoramic Golden Gate Bridge and Downtown views. Enjoy a south facing side yard, and rear garden ideal for herbs. Just blocks from Golden Gate Park, Lafayette Elementary, Presidio Middle and Washington High with vibrant shops on Geary, Clement, and Balboa. A true San Francisco gem with timeless charm and boundless upside."
  },
